WEBVTT

00:07:34.356 --> 00:07:39.796
The fight to breathe clean air is real.

00:07:41.196 --> 00:07:45.156
When I say "Breathe life,"

00:07:45.156 --> 00:07:46.556
what do you say?

00:07:47.476 --> 00:07:49.916
You say, "Clean air is our right!"

00:07:49.956 --> 00:07:51.236
Breathe life!

00:07:51.276 --> 00:07:53.596
Audience: Clean air is our right!

00:07:54.156 --> 00:07:55.636
RAKD: Thank you for listening.

00:07:55.676 --> 00:07:56.916
Thank you very much.

00:07:56.916 --> 00:07:59.796
(Applause and cheers)

00:07:59.836 --> 00:08:02.836
[Take action on climate change
at countdown.ted.com]